## Character Art Assets

The character art assets (PNG/WebP files in `android/app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/`,
`web/assets/ashu/portraits/`, and the reference sheet `assets/ashu_design_reference_sheet.png`)
are provided under a **separate license** from the Ashu 2D Character Asset Pack.

See `assets/ASHU_ASSET_MANIFEST.json` for the full asset list and licensing terms.
These assets are **not** covered by the MIT license above.

